+    /// Not modeled, left 0: the rest of dword 1 (STRIDE, SWIZZLE_ENABLE) and
+    /// of dword 3 (DST_SEL_XYZW, INDEX_STRIDE, ADD_TID_ENABLE, OOB_SELECT,
+    /// TYPE). No word of the API description (an SRV's padding, the high
